Package: linuxnvidiahwcc
Version: @VERSION@-@PKGREL@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AtmanActive <AtmanActive@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @SHLIBS@, python3 (>= 3.9), python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtnetwork, libkscreen-bin, systemd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/AtmanActive/Linux-Nvidia-Hardware-Colour-Controls
Description: NVIDIA hardware colour controls for KDE Plasma (Wayland)
 NVIDIA Control Panel style Brightness, Contrast, Gamma and Digital Vibrance
 for KDE Plasma 6 on Wayland, applied only in the GPU's display hardware: the
 CRTC gamma LUT (through KWin) and the NVIDIA display engine's digital
 vibrance. No software, shader or per-application colour correction.
